{"id":"12b65ff45a1e7d01","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence.md","title":"Kurtz clopen 检验与零测度有效闭类等价","display":"thm-kurtz-test-equivalence — Kurtz clopen 检验与零测度有效闭类等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence","aliases":["20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence"],"display":"thm-kurtz-test-equivalence — Kurtz clopen 检验与零测度有效闭类等价","chapter":"11","section":"11.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definition 11.4.3 后的等价说明","source_printed_pages":[193],"source_pdf_pages":[224],"depends_on":["[[20-df-kurtz-test]]","[[20-df-kurtz-random]]","[[20-thm-closed-class-measure]]","[[20-df-closed-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kurtz-test-equivalence — Kurtz clopen 检验与零测度有效闭类等价"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 11.4.3 后的等价说明"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>224</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"461236997f41a313\" href=\"?note=461236997f41a313\" title=\"20-df-kurtz-test\">20-df-kurtz-test</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"323381492f97cb49\" href=\"?note=323381492f97cb49\" title=\"20-df-kurtz-random\">20-df-kurtz-random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e87bcedc6718afa\" href=\"?note=3e87bcedc6718afa\" title=\"20-thm-closed-class-measure\">20-thm-closed-class-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"461236997f41a313\" href=\"?note=461236997f41a313\" title=\"20-df-kurtz-test\">20-df-kurtz-test</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"323381492f97cb49\" href=\"?note=323381492f97cb49\" title=\"20-df-kurtz-random\">20-df-kurtz-random</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3e87bcedc6718afa\" href=\"?note=3e87bcedc6718afa\" title=\"20-thm-closed-class-measure\">20-thm-closed-class-measure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kurtz-test-equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{KurtzRandom}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall V\\ [\\operatorname{KurtzTest}(V)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_n V_n].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kurtz-test-equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{KurtzRandom}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall V\\ [\\operatorname{KurtzTest}(V)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_n V_n].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一致有效 clopen 的交是有效闭类；其测度至多每层严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-n}\">\\(2^{-n}\\)</span>，故为 0。反向，对可计算树表示的零测度闭类，层测度递减到 0；逐次搜索严格递增的层数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(n)\\ge n\">\\(p(n)\\ge n\\)</span>，使该层测度小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-n}\">\\(2^{-n}\\)</span>。搜索有效且终止，所选有限层柱并一致给出 Kurtz 检验，交恰为原闭类。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.4.3 后的等价说明；印刷页 193；PDF 第 224 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-kurtz-test","status":"resolved","id":"461236997f41a313","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-kurtz-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-kurtz-random","status":"resolved","id":"323381492f97cb49","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-kurtz-random]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-closed-class-measure","status":"resolved","id":"3e87bcedc6718afa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-closed-class-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-kurtz-test","status":"resolved","id":"461236997f41a313","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kurtz-test]]；see [[20-df-kurtz-random]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-kurtz-random","status":"resolved","id":"323381492f97cb49","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kurtz-test]]；see [[20-df-kurtz-random]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-closed-class-measure","status":"resolved","id":"3e87bcedc6718afa","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kurtz-test]]；see [[20-df-kurtz-random]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kurtz-test]]；see [[20-df-kurtz-random]]；see [[20-thm-closed-class-measure]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kurtz-test-equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{KurtzRandom}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall V\\ [\\operatorname{KurtzTest}(V)\\Rightarrow X\\notin\\bigcap_n V_n].","display":true},{"tex":"2^{-n}","display":false},{"tex":"p(n)\\ge n","display":false},{"tex":"2^{-n}","display":false}],"bytes":1535,"backlinks":[{"id":"84c39ea3efb71898","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-kurtz-random]]；see [[20-df-random]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-df-ml-test]]；see [[20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence]]；see [[20-thm-null-class-no-random]]。"}],"outgoing":["461236997f41a313","323381492f97cb49","3e87bcedc6718afa","b73290a0af01d44f"]}